    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t is on englisc lyftadl & wi\u00fe neurisne \u00fery. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 bryne & sealfa, VIII ealra. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe li\u00f0 w\u00e6rce & wi\u00f0 li\u00feseawe & gif li\u00feseaw sio & lio\u00feole utryrne, ealra cr\u00e6fta L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe feferadle to h\u00e6lanne, drencas wi\u00f0 \u00fean wi\u00fe \u00feriddan d\u00e6ges f\u00e6re & feor\u00fean d\u00e6ges f\u00e6re & hu man sceal wi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6re adle on husl disce \u00feone halgan & \u00feone miclan godes naman writan & on L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00f0 feond seocum men, drencas to \u00feon & hu mon scyle m\u00e6ssan & gebedu & sealmas L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00e6lcre leodrunan & \u00e6lfsidenne, \u00fe\u00e6t is fefercynnes gealdor & dust & drencas & sealf L\u00e6cedomas eft wi\u00f0 lenctenadle & \u00feara feower godspellera naman & gewritu & gebedu & swigende L\u00e6cedomas ungemynde & wi\u00fe dysigum. L\u00e6cedomas & drencas wi\u00f0 genumenum mete & gif eala sie awerd o\u00fe\u00fee meolcen mete, \u00fery cr\u00e6ftas. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe \u00feon gif hunta gebite mannan, \u00fe\u00e6t swi\u00f0re o\u00fere naman gangelwefra, sex dugende L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe wede hundes slite & wi\u00f0 hundes dolge, VII l\u00e6cedomas. L\u00e6cedomas gif mon sie to wr\u00e6ne o\u00fe\u00fee to unwr\u00e6ne. L\u00e6cedomas wi\u00fe r\u00e6ge reosan sare & gif hoh sino forod sie. L\u00e6cedomas on hwilce tid blod sie to forganne on hwilce to forl\u00e6tenne & hu sie attres ful sio lyft on Rom",
